WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.338
The Little Mermaid felt the warmth of the morning sun on her face.

2
00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:13.115
To her surprise she was not dead and had not turned into sea foam.

3
00:00:13.116 --> 00:00:17.268
Instead she was floating above the water.

4
00:00:17.269 --> 00:00:22.663
"It is dawn and I am still alive?" she wondered.

5
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:28.344
Above her head were two strange beings in long, white robes.

6
00:00:28.345 --> 00:00:31.516
They looked as if they were waiting to greet her.

7
00:00:31.517 --> 00:00:35.635
They smiled as they floated in the air like clouds.

8
00:00:35.636 --> 00:00:40.646
She tried to touch them, but her hand went right through them.

9
00:00:40.647 --> 00:00:45.901
The Little Mermaid soon discovered that she was dressed in a robe too.

10
00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:51.871
Like them she was also part of the air and floating like a cloud.

11
00:00:51.872 --> 00:00:56.967
Without thinking she called out to them, "Who are you?"

12
00:00:56.968 --> 00:01:01.248
To her surprise she heard her own voice.

13
00:01:01.249 --> 00:01:06.836
And it was just as beautiful as it had been before she gave it to the Sea Witch.

14
00:01:06.837 --> 00:01:11.752
"We are the Spirits of the Air," one of them replied.

15
00:01:11.753 --> 00:01:15.770
"We travel through the world doing good deeds."

16
00:01:15.771 --> 00:01:19.975
"Why am I here with you?" the Little Mermaid asked.

17
00:01:19.976 --> 00:01:29.711
"Your loyalty to the Prince and your sacrifice has raised you up to the world of Air Spirits," the other said.

18
00:01:29.712 --> 00:01:32.719
"You are now one of us."

19
00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.224
The mermaid was curious.

20
00:01:35.225 --> 00:01:36.827
"I need to know more.

21
00:01:36.828 --> 00:01:40.441
Do you live for three hundred years like the sea folk?

22
00:01:40.442 --> 00:01:43.469
Do you have a soul like the humans?"

23
00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:49.189
"Here, in our world, we also live for three hundred years.

24
00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.576
But we can earn our souls.

25
00:01:51.577 --> 00:01:55.546
When we do, we live forever."

26
00:01:55.547 --> 00:01:59.927
"I’ve always wanted a soul," said the

27
00:01:59.928 --> 00:02:02.793
mermaid. "What must I do to deserve

28
00:02:02.794 --> 00:02:12.397
one?" "If you do many good deeds throughout your three hundred years, you will get a soul," answered one of the air

29
00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:14.929
spirits. "Exactly what is a good

30
00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:19.100
deed?" asked the Little Mermaid, now very

31
00:02:19.101 --> 00:02:23.697
interested. "A good deed is when you do something nice for

32
00:02:23.698 --> 00:02:27.619
humans. The Spirits of the Air watch over

33
00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:32.953
humans. We bring them food when they are hungry and clothes when they are

34
00:02:32.954 --> 00:02:38.543
cold. Sometimes we whisper good thoughts into their ears when they are

35
00:02:38.544 --> 00:02:42.636
sad. We try to help in any way we

36
00:02:42.637 --> 00:02:46.910
can." Pleased, the Little Mermaid looked down to the

37
00:02:46.911 --> 00:02:52.128
earth. She liked the idea of watching over the humans, whom she had learned to

38
00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:58.951
love. "I finally have a chance to earn a soul," she said,

39
00:02:58.952 --> 00:03:05.811
laughing. The Little Mermaid’s joy was so great that, for the first time in her life, she began to

40
00:03:05.812 --> 00:03:11.266
cry. Her tears of happiness fell one by one into the sea below

41
00:03:11.267 --> 00:03:15.256
her. Then the Little Mermaid saw the grand

42
