ship. She could see that everyone on board was now

43
00:03:19.333 --> 00:03:23.910
awake. The Prince and his bride were looking for her and calling

44
00:03:23.911 --> 00:03:29.441
out. After a while they just gazed sadly out to

45
00:03:29.442 --> 00:03:33.979
sea. "What has happened to my little companion?" wondered the

46
00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.668
Prince. "She was so faithful to

47
00:03:36.669 --> 00:03:41.969
me." The Little Mermaid blew him a kiss that turned into a white

48
00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:46.696
feather. Floating softly down, it brushed the Prince’s

49
00:03:46.697 --> 00:03:50.182
